From ead914360aa4776065bc5c5cfe586fa582755306 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Champagne <cjchampagne@habana.ai>
Date: Mon, 09 Jun 2025 15:37:10 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-222861] g3: pldm: mask subsensors by platform

Some state sensors have sub-sensors that should be supported on
HL325 and not HL338. Mask select sub-sensors of the following:
        Gaudi3 power and performance state
        Gaudi3 OAM last power down cause 1
        Gaudi3 OAM last power down cause 4
        Gaudi3 OAM last power down cause 5
        Gaudi3 OAM last power down cause 7

Change-Id: I97431968c78bfe3e93a6fa9358f89a91af1f37ad
Signed-off-by: Christopher Champagne <cjchampagne@habana.ai>
---

diff --git a/arch/gaudi3/common/ras/pldm/pldm_pdr.c b/arch/gaudi3/common/ras/pldm/pldm_pdr.c
index cc3b671..e55b4d9 100644
